feedback.m04.l37.construct|Declare a callable log_route_status function.
lesson.m04.l38.title|Reusable Safe Route
lesson.m04.l38.requirement|Combine the safety decision in a run_safe_route function.
feedback.m04.l38.construct|Declare a callable run_safe_route function.
